### Donnees generales (installation address) — same payload returned for both mock PRMs.
GET {{ENEDIS_API}}/donnees_generales_auto/v1/99999999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{ENEDIS_TOKEN}}

### Donnees generales — three-phase mock PRM.
GET {{ENEDIS_API}}/donnees_generales_auto/v1/11111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{ENEDIS_TOKEN}}

### Donnees generales — unknown PRM. Expect the ITC error payload.
GET {{ENEDIS_API}}/donnees_generales_auto/v1/12345678901234
Authorization: Bearer {{ENEDIS_TOKEN}}
